    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Breaking away from Moon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious alien beings have constructed a strange structure on the Moon\u2014and you're trapped inside it. Navigate your way back to Earth through a vertical labyrinth filled with unexpected challenges. Will you escape, or remain lost in the depths of this otherworldly prison?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Familiar, yet unique</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intuitive controls, movement feels instantly familiar\u2014move left, move right, and jump. But there's a twist: you also control your rotation, adding an extra layer of challenge to every jump and landing. Precision is key\u2014land the wrong way, and you might not get back up. Can you master the physics and find your way home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravitational Challenge:</strong> As you ascend, gravity weakens, making movement trickier and requiring careful control of momentum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Gameplay:</strong> Master precise jumps and rotations to avoid obstacles and land safely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist, Atmospheric Design:</strong> A simple yet immersive art style enhances the feeling of isolation and mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey Through Space:</strong> Progress from deep underground to the Moon's surface and beyond, experiencing different environments along the way.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Breaking away from Moon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious alien beings have constructed a strange structure on the Moon\u2014and you're trapped inside it. Navigate your way back to Earth through a vertical labyrinth filled with unexpected challenges. Will you escape, or remain lost in the depths of this otherworldly prison?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Familiar, yet unique</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intuitive controls, movement feels instantly familiar\u2014move left, move right, and jump. But there's a twist: you also control your rotation, adding an extra layer of challenge to every jump and landing. Precision is key\u2014land the wrong way, and you might not get back up. Can you master the physics and find your way home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravitational Challenge:</strong> As you ascend, gravity weakens, making movement trickier and requiring careful control of momentum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Gameplay:</strong> Master precise jumps and rotations to avoid obstacles and land safely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist, Atmospheric Design:</strong> A simple yet immersive art style enhances the feeling of isolation and mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey Through Space:</strong> Progress from deep underground to the Moon's surface and beyond, experiencing different environments along the way.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Trapped in an alien structure on the Moon, your only mission is to escape. Navigate the desolate lunar surface and the vastness of space to find your way back to Earth.",
